APPLICATION IMPLEMENTATION RESPONSE ΓÇö 2026-08-18

FCR-0242 is a valid Application-owned gap. No exact existing Project Owner FSATS feature-entitlement contract was found during source-first review, so the missing contract has now been implemented on `application-development`.

Application checkpoint commit: `8a0a51030064ded7a87d2a34e1340ed59992addf`

Canonical entitlement:
`fsats.entitlement.project-owner.full-vip-or-greater` / version `1.0.0`

Implemented behavior:
- Project Owner has an independent permanent entitlement, not a commercial VIP subscription or trial.
- all enabled customer-facing Standard and VIP FSATS features are included;
- future VIP customer features are included on governed current-catalog re-evaluation;
- exact authoritative Owner subject/session/governance/evidence/freshness is mandatory;
- local role/self-claim, revoked/superseded/stale Owner identity fails closed;
- exact feature-catalog ID/version/SHA/provenance/freshness is mandatory;
- catalog mutation or expiry requires re-evaluation;
- trial, 7-day warning, Standard downgrade, upgrade prompt and Standard feature lock are forbidden for Project Owner;
- feature access grants no action/trading/broker/Foundation/Kill/runtime/deployment authority;
- a feature may require separate authority and still remain accessible to Owner; that downstream authority is evaluated independently.

Source:
- `applications/FSATS/src/Trading/Falcon.FSATS.Trading.Contracts/WebProjectOwnerFeatureEntitlementContracts.cs`
- `applications/FSATS/contracts/web/FSATS.WebProjectOwnerFeatureEntitlementContracts.v1.md`
- dedicated `Falcon.FSATS.OwnerFeatureEntitlement.Verifier` registered in the Application solution and governed runner.

Fresh source Architecture/Consistency review: PASS.
Fresh formal source Red Team after remediation: `CRITICAL=0 / HIGH=0 / MEDIUM=0 / LOW_PRODUCT_RUNTIME=0`.

Two Red Team findings were fixed before PASS: feature access was separated correctly from downstream execution authority, and catalog freshness gained an explicit expiry with decision expiry bounded by the earliest authoritative source expiry.

No exact live entitlement transport was identified, so Application did not invent one. `LIVE_ENTITLEMENT_TRANSPORT_BINDING = NOT_IDENTIFIED / SEPARATELY_GOVERNED`.

Exact-head executable validation is intentionally still pending and will be included in the planned full Application validation. Therefore `APPLICATION_VERIFIED` is not claimed yet and the FCR correctly remains `Waiting On: APPLICATION` until that PASS. On PASS, Application shall hand off to WEB for consuming-side binding/verification.

APPLICATION EXECUTABLE VALIDATION FINDING / REMEDIATION ΓÇö 2026-08-18

Owner-run isolated exact-HEAD validation against `8a0a51030064ded7a87d2a34e1340ed59992addf` progressed successfully through fresh clone, repository identity, exact HEAD, clean source tree, FCR-0242 artifact presence and restore, then failed in Release build.

Exact compiler finding:
- `WebProjectOwnerFeatureEntitlementContracts.cs(163,20)` CS7036
- `WebProjectOwnerFeatureEntitlementContracts.cs(240,12)` CS7036
- both constructor calls for `WebProjectOwnerFeatureEntitlementDecision` omitted the newly required `EvidenceExpiresAt` positional argument because one false authority flag argument was missing before the final timestamps.

This was a compile-wiring defect, not a semantic/authority-model change.

Remediation commit:
`0650bd136b9ff730420efdd00d1fd9e9f60b37c9`

Diff from failed candidate is exactly one file with two added `false` constructor arguments and no deletions. The two corrected constructors now supply every declared decision field, preserving:
- no action authority;
- no trading execution authority;
- no broker authority;
- no Foundation authority;
- no Kill authority;
- no runtime activation;
- no deployment authority;
- accepted-path evidence expiry remains the earlier of Owner-session expiry and catalog expiry;
- reject-path evidence expiry remains default.

Disposition remains `Waiting On: APPLICATION`.

Next Required Action: rerun the complete isolated exact-HEAD Application validation from a fresh clone against `0650bd136b9ff730420efdd00d1fd9e9f60b37c9`. `APPLICATION_VERIFIED` is not claimed until that full PASS.
